{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "在丙辰大限（43–52），命主在哪一年出国创业？和什么领域相关？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "命主命宫主星天机、太阴，位于申宫得地。丙辰大限（43–52岁）为第五大限，命造为阴男逆行，大限辰宫天干丙使天机化权，使命宫天机由权星带动，增强策划与变动能力，太阴则为田宅主星，与地产、女性、教育亦有关联。\n\n各流年分析：\n- 2015乙未年，天干乙使天机化禄、太阴化忌，太阴为本命主星之一，化忌直接冲射命宫，易生波动，不宜创业。\n- 2017丁酉年，天干丁使太阴化禄、天机化科，命宫两颗主星双双吉化，是发动事业的最佳时机；太阴化禄与田宅、女性、培训相关，天机化科主教育、儿童、策划，结合大限天机化权的能动性，最可能投入儿童培训领域。\n- 2018戊戌年，天干戊使天机化忌，命宫受冲，运势不佳，不利开创新局。\n- 2019己亥年，四化无直接吉化命宫主星，且已非最佳起步时机。\n\n综合判断，2017年启动且与儿童培训领域最为契合。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b2b_R0_P0_G3\\details_2025_b2b_R0_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 21452, "response_id": "6abe9e44-74d9-455a-a78b-09dc0de42ceb", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 263, "completion_tokens": 1212, "total_tokens": 1475, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 922}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 263}}
