{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n命主八字为癸丑 庚申 壬辰 庚子，水旺身强，原局不见火暖局。现行丙辰大运，2024甲辰流年，岁运同为辰土，构成岁运并临且与日柱伏吟，为运势动荡之年。地支申子辰三合水局，使壬水过旺，用神甲木食神坐辰土水库之上，形成水多木漂之势，用神受损。甲木主筋骨、四肢，辰土为足、为水库，水旺木漂，有行动受阻、肢体受伤之象。大运丙火本为喜神，但流年水势泛滥，湿木难生火。命宫天机（肢体）太阴（水）亦主手足问题。综合判断，突发意外伤灾可能性高，易因交通（申为驿马传运）导致下肢骨折。\n\n### 最终答案\nD", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b2b_R0_P0_G3\\details_2025_b2b_R0_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 57212, "response_id": "e42ec59b-a765-4ee9-a521-fdf9bb8d7dc4", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 260, "completion_tokens": 2847, "total_tokens": 3107, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2640}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 260}}
